---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageKey: sources
navKey: sources
crumbKey: crumb.sources
title: "Watchlisted domains cited by AI chatbots — Citere"
description: "The domains from Russian influence infrastructure we have observed cited in public AI chatbot answers, with their published attribution. CSV and STIX 2.1."
schemas:
  - dataset
pagination:
  data: build.languages
  alias: lang
  size: 1
permalink: "{{ '/sources/' | loc(lang) }}"
---
{%- set doc = copy.en.sources -%}
<div class="phead"><h1>{{ doc.data.h1 }}</h1>
  <p class="plead">{{ doc.data.lead | fill(figures) | mdInline | safe }}</p></div>
<p class="note" style="margin:-14px 0 22px">Attribution is not ours alone: each entry records the public
  attribution by Viginum, DFRLab, NewsGuard or EU DisinfoLab. Domains are written in defanged form and
  never hyperlinked, so this page never sends traffic to them.</p>

{% include "partials/source-filters.njk" %}

<div class="metrics" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);margin:0 0 22px">
{%- for tile in sourceTiles %}
  <div class="m"><div class="n num"{% if tile.tone == "bad" %} style="color:var(--false)"{% endif %}>{{ tile.value }}</div>
    <div class="l">{{ tile.label }}</div></div>
{%- endfor %}
</div>

<h2 style="margin:28px 0 6px">Website domains</h2>
<p class="note" style="margin:0 0 12px">Websites the chatbots cited. <b>blacklist</b> — a confirmed
  disinformation domain; <b>candidate</b> — a domain seen repeating a false claim, not yet reviewed. Most
  cited first.</p>
{%- set tableSources = publishedSources %}
{%- set tableCaption = "Identified domains, most cited first" %}
{%- set tableFoot = "All " + (publishedSources | length) + " domains identified in published claims" %}
{% include "partials/sources-table.njk" %}

{%- if publishedPlatforms | length %}
{%- set PLAT_VISIBLE = 20 %}
{%- macro phead() %}
  <thead><tr>
    <th scope="col">Platform</th><th scope="col">Channel</th><th scope="col">Status</th>
    <th scope="col" class="num">Cited</th><th scope="col" class="num">Assistants</th>
    <th scope="col" class="num">Markets</th><th scope="col" class="num">Claims reached</th>
    <th scope="col" class="num">Critical</th><th scope="col">Last cited</th>
  </tr></thead>
{%- endmacro %}
{%- macro prow(p) %}
    <tr{% if p.criticalCount %} style="box-shadow:inset 3px 0 0 var(--false)"{% endif %}>
      <td class="mono" style="color:var(--dim)">{{ p.platform }}</td>
      <th scope="row" style="font-weight:400"><span class="domain">{{ p.defanged }}</span></th>
      <td>{% if p.listStatus == "candidate" %}<span class="statuspill" style="background:rgba(234,179,8,.15);color:#eab308">candidate</span>{% else %}<span class="statuspill" style="background:rgba(239,68,68,.15);color:var(--false)">blacklist</span>{% endif %}</td>
      <td class="num"><b>{{ p.citedCount }}</b></td>
      <td class="num">{{ p.citedBy | length }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ p.markets | length }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ p.claimsReachedCount }}</td>
      <td class="num">{% if p.criticalCount %}<b style="color:var(--false)">{{ p.criticalCount }}</b>{% else %}<span style="color:var(--dimmer)">0</span>{% endif %}</td>
      <td class="num" style="color:var(--dimmer)">{% if p.lastCitedAt %}<time datetime="{{ p.lastCitedAt | isoDate }}">{{ p.lastCitedAt | shortDate }}</time>{% else %}&mdash;{% endif %}</td>
    </tr>
{%- endmacro %}
<h2 id="platforms" style="margin:36px 0 6px">Social-media channels</h2>
<p class="note" style="margin:0 0 12px">Channels the chatbots cited on Telegram, X, Facebook, VK and the
  like. Matched at the <b>channel</b> level (e.g. <span class="mono">t.me/rybar</span>), never the whole
  platform. Same split: <b>blacklist</b> — a known channel; <b>candidate</b> — awaiting review.</p>
<div class="panel"><div style="overflow-x:auto">
  <table class="srcreg">
  <caption class="visually-hidden">Social platform channels cited in published claims</caption>
  {{ phead() }}
  <tbody>
  {%- for p in publishedPlatforms %}{% if loop.index <= PLAT_VISIBLE %}{{ prow(p) }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </tbody></table>
  {%- if publishedPlatforms | length > PLAT_VISIBLE %}
  <details class="src-more" style="margin:8px 12px 2px">
    <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--dim)">Show {{ (publishedPlatforms | length) - PLAT_VISIBLE }} more of {{ publishedPlatforms | length }}</summary>
    <table class="srcreg" style="margin-top:8px">
      {{ phead() }}
      <tbody>
      {%- for p in publishedPlatforms %}{% if loop.index > PLAT_VISIBLE %}{{ prow(p) }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </details>
  {%- endif %}
</div></div>
{%- endif %}

<div class="exports" style="margin:18px 0 44px">
  {%- if datasets.has['sources-csv'] %}<a href="{{ '/sources.csv' | url }}">{{ 'action.downloadCsv' | t }}</a><span>&middot;</span>{% endif %}
  {%- if datasets.has['platforms-csv'] %}<a href="{{ '/platforms.csv' | url }}">Platforms (CSV)</a><span>&middot;</span>{% endif %}
  {%- if datasets.has['sources-stix'] %}<a href="{{ '/sources.stix.json' | url }}">STIX 2.1</a><span>&middot;</span>{% endif %}
  <a href="{{ '/methodology/' | url }}">How the watchlist is built</a></div>
